&lt;h2 id="garden-description">Garden Description&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>The garden (a) and cistern that was in the southwest corner of this house had been paved over by CE 79. There was a &lt;em>puteal&lt;/em> in the courtyard.&lt;/p>
